This plugin adds excerpts for Pages


== Description ==

This plugin automaticaly adds excerpts for Pages


== Installation ==

1. Upload 'excerpts-for-pages.php' to the '/wp-content/plugins/' directory
2. Activate the plugin through the 'Plugins' menu in WordPress
3. Enjoy!

